      "content": "French (B.A.) 120 units",
      "contentHtml": null
    },
    {
      "id": "09ac6f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
      "type": "GeneralText",
      "area": "General",
      "position": 2,
      "content": "Program Description The B.A. in French offers students the ability to learn speaking writing, and analytical skills in French. It also introduces them to the various cultures of France, and the Francophone world. Students acquire an understanding of those countries’ historical background and contemporary issues while developing their proficiency in French. The program fosters critical approaches to Francophone Literatures and Cultures. The program prepares students for an ever-changing world and offers career opportunities in International government, business, travel, communications, and other fields where the knowledge of more than one language is essential.",
      "contentHtml": "<p>Program Description</p><p>The B.A. in French offers students the ability to learn speaking writing, and analytical skills in French.&nbsp;It also introduces them to the various cultures of France, and the Francophone world.&nbsp;Students acquire an understanding of those countries’ historical background and contemporary issues while developing their proficiency in French.&nbsp;The program fosters critical approaches to Francophone Literatures and Cultures.&nbsp;The program prepares students for an ever-changing world and offers career opportunities in International government, business, travel, communications, and other fields where the knowledge of more than one language is essential.</p><p><br></p>"
    }
  ],
